WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:09,140
Also with Chen Yundong

2
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,780
It's getting dark, it's already night

3
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:11,780
You should go home

4
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,180
Give me the car keys and give me this money.

5
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,220
Take a taxi back yourself

6
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:18,780
Just go to the company directly tomorrow

7
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:23,570
My job is 24 hours a day

8
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:24,730
There is no upper and lower half

9
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,780
You don't really plan to come home with me and live in my house, do you?

10
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:32,870
This is the arrangement your father gave me

11
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:35,950
Why are you so stubborn? Is this okay?

12
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:38,550
Can I rent an apartment for you near my home?

13
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:40,190
I'll arrange a room for you in the hotel

14
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:43,060
From now on, you will stay there at night. My dad asked about it.

15
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:45,220
I just said, can you live at my place?

16
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:47,020
My dad doesn’t know anyway

17
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,060
few years fresh

18
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:51,900
It’s all in the company’s development plan, worth hundreds of millions.

19
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:53,220
Still have to wait for dad’s approval

20
00:00:54,140 --> 00:01:02,630
Can you just say something? No, Chen Yundong.

21
00:01:02,990 --> 00:01:03,910
I'm a single woman

22
00:01:03,910 --> 00:01:05,710
I live alone. Do you think you are a grown man?

23
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:08,610
Is it okay to live with me? Don't worry.

24
00:01:09,130 --> 00:01:10,090
I would never offend you

25
00:01:12,130 --> 00:01:19,180
If you say you can't, I'll believe you. Why should I believe that you won't offend me? That's your business.

26
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,760
You are simply unreasonable

27
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:30,220
Mao Keli's stone is smelly and hard. Dad, can you be unreasonable? Just follow the original arrangement.

28
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:35,030
When you get to my house, I have the final say
